## 📁 Project File Upload & Download Features

The app supports:

| Feature | Android | iOS | Windows |
|---------|---------|-----|---------|
| File download (PDF, DOC, images, etc.) | ✅ → Downloads/ | ✅ → Files app | ✅ → Downloads/ |
| File upload via `<input type="file">` | ✅ Camera + Gallery + Files | ✅ Camera + Files | ✅ System picker |
| Camera capture for upload | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ (if webcam) |
| Multi-file upload | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Download progress notification | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

### How downloads work
- Any link on the website ending in `.pdf`, `.docx`, `.xlsx`, `.zip`, `.jpg`, etc. is automatically intercepted
- The app downloads the file in the background
- A snackbar shows download progress and confirms save location
- Files are saved to the device's **Downloads** folder (Android) or **Files app** (iOS)

### How uploads work
- Any `<input type="file">` on the website triggers the native file picker
- Users can choose: Camera, Gallery, or Browse Files
- Supports single and multiple file selection
- Works for forms like admission applications, document submissions, etc.

