## 🔧 Customization

| What | Where |
|------|-------|
| School URL | `lib/screens/home_screen.dart` → `_url` constant |
| App name | `pubspec.yaml` → `name` + `android/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml` |
| Bundle ID | `android/app/build.gradle` + `ios/Runner/Info.plist` |
| App colors | `lib/main.dart` + `lib/screens/splash_screen.dart` |
| App logo | Replace `assets/logo.png` (1024×1024 PNG), then re-run `flutter pub run flutter_launcher_icons` |
| Splash background color | `pubspec.yaml` → `flutter_native_splash: color:` |

---

## 🐛 Common Errors

| Error | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `INTERNET permission denied` | Check AndroidManifest.xml has `<uses-permission android:name="android.permission.INTERNET"/>` |
| `WebView not loading` | Run `flutter clean && flutter pub get` |
| `Cocoapods error on iOS` | `cd ios && pod deintegrate && pod install` |
| `Gradle build failed` | Ensure Java 17: `java -version`. Set in Android Studio → SDK Manager |
| `Windows build error` | Run from **Developer Command Prompt for VS 2022** |
| `firebase_options not found` | Run `flutterfire configure` to generate the file |
| `File upload not working on Android` | Ensure `permission_handler` permissions are declared in AndroidManifest |

